s-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.38%\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px\"><em>Nature</em>, in the common sense, refers to essences unchanged by man; space, the air, the river, the leaf. <em>Art</em> is applied to the mixture of his will with the same things, as in a house, a canal, a statue, a picture. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px\">But his operations taken together are so insignificant, a little chipping, baking, patching, and washing, that in an impression so grand as that of the world on the human mind, they do not vary the result.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33%\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:2vw\"></div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Il sole che tramonta attraverso una fitta foresta di alberi.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-01.jpg\"></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.62%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Turbine eoliche in piedi su una pianura erbosa, con un cielo blu sullo sfondo.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-02.jpg\"></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-90cda669 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:69%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Il sole splende su un crinale che conduce alla costa. In lontananza, un&apos;auto scende lungo una strada.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-03.jpg\"></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33%\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:2vw\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px\">Indubbiamente non abbiamo domande da porre senza risposta. Dobbiamo fidarci della perfezione della creazione fino a questo punto, da credere che qualunque curiosità l&#8217;ordine delle cose ha risvegliato nelle nostre menti, l&#8217;ordine delle cose può soddisfare. La condizione di ogni uomo è una soluzione in geroglifico a quelle domande che avrebbe posto.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\";s:9:\"protected\";b:0;}s:4:\"meta\";O:8:\"stdClass\":8:{s:13:\"wpop_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"wpop_description\";s:83:\"Tre colonne con immagini e testo, con spaziatura verticale per un aspetto sfalsato.\";s:19:\"wpop_viewport_width\";i:1200;s:16:\"wpop_block_types\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:11:\"wpop_locale\";s:5:\"it_IT\";s:15:\"wpop_wp_version\";s:0:\"\";s:25:\"wpop_contains_block_types\";s:86:\"core/column,core/columns,core/group,core/heading,core/image,core/paragraph,core/spacer\";s:9:\"footnotes\";s:0:\"\";}s:14:\"category_slugs\";a:4:{i:0;s:7:\"columns\";i:1;s:7:\"gallery\";i:2;s:6:\"images\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";}s:13:\"keyword_slugs\";a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"core\";i:1;s:8:\"featured\";}s:15:\"pattern_content\";s:5190:\"<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#f5eac1\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"6vw\",\"bottom\":\"6vw\",\"left\":\"6vw\",\"right\":\"6vw\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#f5eac1;padding-top:6vw;padding-right:6vw;padding-bottom:6vw;padding-left:6vw\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"16px\",\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"ve