 of his will with the same things, as in a house, a canal, a statue, a picture. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px\">But his operations taken together are so insignificant, a little chipping, baking, patching, and washing, that in an impression so grand as that of the world on the human mind, they do not vary the result.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33%\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2vw\"} -->\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:2vw\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Il sole che tramonta attraverso una fitta foresta di alberi.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-01.jpg\"></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"33.62%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:33.62%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Turbine eoliche in piedi su una pianura erbosa, con un cielo blu sullo sfondo.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-02.jpg\"></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"3vw\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"69%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:69%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"Il sole splende su un crinale che conduce alla costa. In lontananza, un&apos;auto scende lungo una strada.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/outside-03.jpg\"></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"33%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:33%\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2vw\"} -->\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:2vw\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000;font-size:17px\">Indubbiamente non abbiamo domande da porre senza risposta. Dobbiamo fidarci della perfezione della creazione fino a questo punto, da credere che qualunque curiosità l\'ordine delle cose ha risvegliato nelle nostre menti, l\'ordine delle cose può soddisfare. La condizione di ogni uomo è una soluzione in geroglifico a quelle domande che avrebbe posto.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\";}i:12;O:8:\"stdClass\":7:{s:2:\"id\";i:3834;s:5:\"title\";O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:41:\"Media e testo con immagine sulla sinistra\";}s:7:\"content\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:645:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignfull is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Primo piano, visione astratta di architettura.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/architecture-04.jpg\"></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Spazi Aperti</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-extra-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"#\">Guarda il caso di studio <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">↗</span></a></p>\n</div></div>\n\";s:9:\"protected\";b:0;}s:4:\"meta\";O:8:\"stdClass\":8:{s:13:\"wpop_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"wpop_description\";s:74:\"Media ed un blocco testo con immagine sulla sinistra e testo sulla destra.\";s:19:\"wpop_viewport_width\";i:1200;s:16:\"wpop_block_types\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:11:\"wpop_locale\";s:5:\"it_IT\";s:15:\"wpop_wp_version\";s:0:\"\";s:25:\"wpop_contains_block_types\";s:43:\"core/heading,core/media-text,core/paragraph\";s:9:\"footnotes\";s:0:\"\";}s:14:\"category_slugs\";a:1:{i:0;s:6:\"banner\";}s:13:\"keyword_slugs\";a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"core\";i:1;s:8:\"featured\";}s:15:\"pattern_content\";s:859:\"<!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"full\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignfull is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img alt=\"Primo piano, visione astratta di architettura.\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/architecture-04.jpg\"></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#000000\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Spazi Aperti</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"extra-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-extra-small-font-size\"><a href=\"#\">Guarda il caso di studio ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\";}i:13;O:8:\"stdClass\":7:{s:2:\"id\";i:5913;s:5:\"title\";O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:43:\"Header largo con testo allineato a sinistra\";}s:7:\"content\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:1430:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:800px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/forest.jpg\"><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:64px\">Foresta.</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-0e47273b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:330px\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3\"><em>Anche un bambino sa quanto sia preziosa la foresta. L&#8217;odore fresco e mozzafiato degli alberi. Uccelli echeggianti che volano sopra quella densa magnitudine. Un clima stabile, una vita diversificata sostenibile e una fonte di cultura. Tuttavia, le foreste e altri ecosistemi sono in bilico, minacciati di diventare terreni coltivati, pascoli e piantagioni.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\";s:9:\"protected\";b:0;}s:4:\"meta\";O:8:\"stdClass\":8:{s:13:\"wpop_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"wpop_description\";s:44:\"Immagine di sfondo con citazione sovrapposta\";s:19:\"wpop_viewport_width\";i:1200;s:16:\"wpop_block_types\";a:1:{i:0;s:0:\"\";}s:11:\"wpop_locale\";s:5:\"it_IT\";s:15:\"wpop_wp_version\";s:0:\"\";s:25:\"wpop_contains_block_types\";s:75:\"core/column,core/columns,core/cover,core/heading,core/paragraph,core/spacer\";s:9:\"footnotes\";s:0:\"\";}s:14:\"category_slugs\";a:1:{i:0;s:6:\"banner\";}s:13:\"keyword_slugs\";a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"core\";i:1;s:8:\"featured\";}s:15:\"pattern_content\";s:1734:\"<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/forest.jpg\",\"dimRatio\":60,\"minHeight\":800,\"align\":\"full\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:800px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/5.8/forest.jpg\"><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffe074\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"64px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:64px\">Foresta.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"55%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"330px\"} -->\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:330px\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffe074\"},\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.3\",\"fontSize\":\"12px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffe074;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3\"><em>Anche un bambino sa quanto sia preziosa la foresta. L\'odore fresco e mozzafiato degli alberi. Uccelli echeggianti che volano sopra quella densa magnitudine. Un clima stabile, una vita diversificata sostenibile e una fonte di cultura. Tuttavia, le foreste e altri ecosistemi sono in bilico, minacciati di diventare terreni coltivati, pascoli e piantagioni.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\";}i:14;O:8:\"stdClass\":7:{s:2:\"id\";i:5914;s:5:\"title\";O:8:\"stdClass\":1:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:12:\"intestazione\";}s:7:\"content\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:8:\"rendered\";s:550:\"\n<h2 class=\"alignwide wp-block-heading\" id=\"we-re-a-studio-in-berlin-with-an-international-practice-in-arch